{"title":"2021 AIME II","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2021 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">AIME</a> II</b> problems and solutions. The test was held on Thursday, March 18, 2021. The first link will contain the full set of test problems. The rest will contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2021 AIME II Problems/Problem 10